{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53518","headline":"游栖岩寺 · 李益","name":"游栖岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚上梯延洞，通宵兴莫穷。\n高明千嶂月，清爽一岩风。\n坐久衣衫润，吟余物象空。\n举头星可摘，疑在广寒宫。\n（见《古今图书集成·山川典》卷三五《中条山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}